{"Score":"Punkte","Smash charge":"Durchbruch-Ladung","Pause (Esc)":"Pause (Esc)","Rotate tower left":"Turm nach links drehen","Rotate tower right":"Turm nach rechts drehen","Undo":"Zurück","Hint":"Tipp","Rotate the tower. Thread the gaps. Dodge the danger sectors.":"Dreh den Turm. Triff die Lücken. Meide die Gefahrenzonen.","▶ Play — {next}":"▶ Spielen – {next}","Daily Drop ✓ done today":"Tagesfall ✓ heute erledigt","Daily Drop":"Tagesfall","Journey":"Reise","Practice":"Training","Challenges":"Herausforderungen","Learn to Play":"Spielen lernen","Scores":"Punkte","Settings":"Einstellungen","How to Play":"So wird gespielt","Title screen. {summary}":"Titelbildschirm. {summary}","start the Journey":"Reise beginnen","{done}/{total} journey stages · daily streak {streak} · {ach}/5 achievements":"{done}/{total} Reise-Etappen · Tagesserie {streak} · {ach}/5 Erfolge","offline mode":"Offline-Modus","cloud synced":"Cloud synchron","saving…":"wird gespeichert …","cloud sync issue":"Problem bei der Cloud-Synchronisierung","offline":"offline","Player":"Spieler","Ranked":"Gewertet","Casual — not rated":"Locker – ohne Wertung","Assists: {list}":"Hilfen: {list}","Rules":"Regeln","Start":"Starten","Stage {n} — {name}":"Etappe {n} – {name}","Theme: {theme}. Par {n}s.":"Thema: {theme}. Par {n} s.","none":"keine","Reach the base by dropping through every ring’s gap.":"Erreiche den Boden, indem du durch die Lücke jedes Rings fällst.","Striped sectors end the run.":"Gestreifte Zonen beenden den Lauf.","Falls of 3+ rings charge a smash.":"Stürze durch 3+ Ringe laden einen Durchbruch.","Practice — {name}":"Training – {name}","A fresh seeded tower. The seed is shown in results for inspection.":"Ein neuer Turm mit Seed. Der Seed steht zur Kontrolle in den Ergebnissen.","undo + hints":"Rückgängig + Tipps","Undo rewinds the last drop.":"Rückgängig nimmt den letzten Fall zurück.","Hints point at the nearest gap.":"Tipps zeigen auf die nächste Lücke.","Nothing here affects ratings.":"Nichts hierv